          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP295 Olds [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Up here today to enjoy some of the Olds block party madness but I didn’t forget about this obsession :)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This was my last unfound cap in town. An easy find (after consulting a certain log). TFTBC.&lt;/p&gt;

