          <groundspeak:finder id="12442378">mikefromcanmore</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP295 OLds -  Always fun capping or caching in these small prairie towns.  Lovely old houses.  Was tempted to stop in at the Purple Yak and have a beverage.  At least to try and find out where the name came from.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
